OL,3,AUS central bank expected to raise
OL,4,Ainterest rates for first time since
OL,5,A2023
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat are interest rates? Interest rates
OL,8,Fset the cost of borrowing money, and
OL,9,Finfluence mortgages, loans and savings
OL,10,Fbut can also boost returns on savings.
OL,11,FCentral banks often hike up rates when
OL,12,Fthey think inflation is too high
OL,14,FPresident Donald Trump has consistently
OL,15,Fopposed hiking interest rates, arguing
OL,16,Flower rates are better for boosting the
OL,17,Feconomy
